OL,3,GNEWSAEngineer shortage blamed for new
OL,4,Adelay for Turkish-built CalMac ferry
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe handover of a new CalMac ferry
OL,7,Fbeing built in Turkey faces another
OL,8,Fshort delay due to a shortage of
OL,9,Fengineers.
OL,11,FMV Loch Indaal was expected to be ready
OL,12,Fby the end of October, but ferries
OL,13,Fagency CMAL said the ship had still not
OL,14,Fsecured final regulator approval.
OL,16,FIn a letter to MSPs, it said the
OL,17,Fhandover was now expected by
OL,18,Fmid-November and would be followed by
OL,19,Fup to 10 days preparation for the
OL,20,Fship's voyage to Scotland.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
