OL,3,GNEWSAEngineer shortage blamed for new
OL,4,Adelay for Turkish-built CalMac ferry
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ship, which was already 20 months
OL,7,Fbehind schedule, will eventually enter
OL,8,Fservice on CalMac's Islay route.
